# Retrofit recommendations can use the same machinery

This is the clever part.

For an existing HMI hull, ask:

> Can this hull itself cover the faction gap with a retrofit?

So before recommending a foreign ship, the engine can test:

```text
Current hull
    ↓
Alternative role profiles
    ↓
Can retrofit reach acceptable score?
```

Example:

```text
Gap:
PD escort

Native option:
Cockroach retrofit
Score: 90

Foreign acquisition:
Enforcer PD
Score: 78

Recommendation:
Use Cockroach retrofit.
```

But:

```text
Gap:
High-end long-range energy

Native retrofit:
Best HMI hull score: 54

Foreign hull:
Paragon: 94
Champion: 83

Recommendation:
Acquire/retrofit foreign hull.
```

That gives you exactly the **“I recommend these”** behavior you want.

